  "message": "We have a few specialists who each focus on a different part of the finance workflow. There’s a cash‑purchase analyst who looks for patterns in cash spend, a card‑purchase analyst for credit‑card transactions, a bank‑payment analyst for ACH and online transfers, and an “other” analyst for checks and uncategorized payments. Once those reports are ready, our synthesizer combines them and flags anything unusual or missing. We also have a receipt scanner that matches receipt images to expenses, an expense reconciler that finds spend without receipts, and a progress checker that can tell you what reports already exist and how up‑to‑date they are.",
